    text: "Affected stops:\r\nAlameda Ave & S Williams St (#25549) (eastbound)\r\nAlameda Ave & S Vine St (#25550) (eastbound)\r\nS University Blvd & Alameda Ave (#25586) (westbound)\r\nAlameda Ave & S Vine St (#25551) (westbound)\r\nAlameda Ave & S Williams St (#25552) (westbound)\r\n\nFor eastbound Route 3 get on/off buses at:\r\nAlameda Ave & S Downing St (#11981)\r\nS University Blvd & Alameda Ave (#16801)\r\n\nFor westbound Route 3 get on/off buses at:\r\nUniversity Blvd & 1st Ave (#16791)\r\nAlameda Ave & S Downing St (#11982)"
